{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31566","headline":"自遣 · 李羣玉","name":"自遣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翻覆升沈百岁中，前途一半已成空。\n浮生暂寄梦中梦，世事如闻风里风。\n修竹万竿资阒寂，古书千卷要穷通。\n一壶浊酒暄和景，谁会陶然失马翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}